 ## Operating characteristics
 
-*   **Time Complexity**: The first pass is $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of leaf nodes. The second pass depends on the number of discontinuities. In the worst case, it may trigger recursive subdivisions, but typically remains efficient.
-*   **Memory Complexity**: $O(N)$ for storing the octree and auxiliary lists. The auxiliary lists are sparse.
